// The 3.1 pack is generated by research/presets/write_presets.py from research/presets/results: every preset is a
// stated intent in numbers, tuned by search through the shipping engine on real material at a standard working
// level (vocals -20 LUFS, drums/bass -18, beats/mixes -12), loudness-matched to the dry signal, and verified at 4x
// on held-out material. Pocket presets duck a beat under the vocal: route the vocal to the side-chain input.
